is the best path forward,

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:05.330
you've got plenty of ways
for you to rebuild things

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:07.560
in the cloud as needed as well.

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:09.350
You can read about the
two main approaches

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:11.670
and what makes them
different here.

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:14.150
OK, that was a lot to process.

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:15.680
The honest answer?

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:18.649
Every digital
transformation is unique

00:04:18.649 --> 00:04:22.590
